WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.260 --> 00:00:04.020
Another thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to
do at the Foundation: Dr. Bright!

00:00:04.020 --> 00:00:05.830
No Shy Guy drag races!

00:00:05.830 --> 00:00:12.810
Dr. Bright is strictly prohibited from starting
drag races between D-Class in cars and SCP-096.

00:00:12.810 --> 00:00:15.440
After the first time, you know how it's going
to end.

00:00:15.440 --> 00:00:16.440
You know what?

00:00:16.440 --> 00:00:19.750
This goes for the other kind of Drag Race,
too.

00:00:19.750 --> 00:00:24.460
Dr. Bright if we see you trying to put a wig,
gown, and high heels on SCP-096 you'll be

00:00:24.460 --> 00:00:26.450
in huge trouble.

00:00:26.450 --> 00:00:30.510
There's no way he can walk the runway without
showing his face.

